  <ferc:DisclosureOfImportantNotesRegardingFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-20" contextRef="c-1">&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;In the year 2025, the Respondent placed into service less than 1 mile of gathering pipelines in Texas.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;The Respondent is a single member LLC. For tax purposes, the Respondent is classified as a Disregarded Entity.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;The Respondent received an updated FERC Tariff No. 1.9.0 effective July 1, 2023.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfImportantNotesRegardingFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
