      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="margin-top:2pt;padding-right:18pt">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Respondent has a cash balance of zero at December 31, 2025, because cash is managed at the Parent company account, using a cash consolidation account.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-2" id="fn-2" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Respondent placed in service less than 1 mile of pipeline in 2025.</span>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-3" id="fn-3" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Respondent is a Single Member LLC formed under the laws of the State of Texas.</span>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-4" id="fn-4" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Respondent placed into operating oil supply the value of the crude oil line-fill and tank bottom.</span>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-5" id="fn-5" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Respondent utilizes a Cash Management Arrangement which has been filed with FERC. The contributions and distributions have been netted.</span>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-6" id="fn-6" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:12pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">The Respondent utilizes a Cash Management Arrangement which has been filed with FERC. The contributions and distributions have been netted.</span>
    </link:footnote>
